    fix(DF-0924-04): as_of + q= returns 400 instead of 500
    
    throwRecallError now maps 'as_of cannot be combined' errors to
    ValidationError (400) instead of ApiError (500). The combination is
    a client validation error, not a server fault.
    
    Test updated to assert 400 + VALIDATION_ERROR code.
    
    Co-authored-by: Alexis Okuwa <wojonstech@gmail.com>
